  "clause_1_scope": "This Indian Standard (IS 14924) covers Synthetic Quartz Crystal s and Guide to the Use. This Indian Standard which is identical with IEC 758 (1993) 'Synthetic quartz crystal — Specifications and guide to the use' including Amendment 1 (1 997) issued by the International Electrotechnical Commission (IEC) was adopted by the for Frequency Control and Selection Sectional Committee and approval of Electronics and Telecommunication Division Council. The objective of this standard is to specify the terminology, standard values and requirements for synthetic quartz crystal and lumbered synthetic quartz crystal and also to provide a guide to the use of synthetic quartz crystal. This standard supersedes IS 9709 : 1 978 'Synthetic quartz single crystal', IS 8899 : 1 978 'Guide for the use of synthetic quartz crystal' and IS 1 01 84 : 1 982 'Lumbered synthetic quartz crystal'. This standard has been brought out to consolidate the provisions of IS 9709, IS 8899 and IS 1 01 84 and align it with the latest international practices. The text of the IEC standard has been approved as suitab",
